    "detailed_description": "Our favorite agents must put a stop to the dangerous and destructive Sexta Secta led by the evil Priest Apoteosis, who is determined to obtain two objects at any cost: the first is the sacred book of the god Ra-Am\u00f3n, and the second is Cleopatra's dung beetle. With these two objects, he intends to perform a curse through a ceremony to the god Ra-Am\u00f3n.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExtended version with alternative passages of the merging of 'Operaci\u00f3n Mosc\u00fa' and 'El Escarabajo de Cleopatra.' Local multiplayer option available.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA great point &amp; click adventure where you can control Mortadelo or Filem\u00f3n according to your preferences: switch between characters and choose who will perform each action.",
